# Winky, built into venture_art.c by spr2c at build time.
#
# Pattern-RAM pictures at 4 bits a pixel: '.' is transparent, and the rest are
# palette slots (1 red, 4 blue, B bright yellow). A room Winky is 16x32 -- two
# slots, one above the other -- because a playfield cell is; he faces four ways,
# looking the way his next arrow will fly. The hall Winky is half size, as the
# arcade draws him, in a single 16x16 slot.

# in a room, facing down
@sprite winky_down 16x32
................
................
......BBBB......
.....BBBBBB.....
....BBBBBBBB....
...BBBBBBBBBB...
...BBBBBBBBBB...
..BBBBBBBBBBBB..
..BBBBBBBBBBBB..
..BBBBBBBBBBBB..
..BBBBBBBBBBBB..
.BBBBBBBBBBBBBB.
.BBBBBBBBBBBBBB.
.BBBBBBBBBBBBBB.
.BBBB44BB44BBBB.
.BBBB44BB44BBBB.
.BBBB44BB44BBBB.
.BBBB44BB44BBBB.
.BBBBBBBBBBBBBB.
.BBBBBBBBBBBBBB.
.BBBBBBBBBBBBBB.
..BBBBBBBBBBBB..
..BBB1BBBB1BBB..
..BBBB1BB1BBBB..
..BBBBB11BBBBB..
...BBBBBBBBBB...
...BBBBBBBBBB...
....BBBBBBBB....
.....BBBBBB.....
......BBBB......
................
................

